message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Zero-TVM: browser LLM inference on hand-written WGSL kernels"
abstract: >-
  Browser LLM inference on hand-written WGSL kernels — models from a 3.8B dense to a 35B sparse MoE, no TVM, no WebLLM runtime, no compiler. Measured against WebLLM on identical weights; every number in BENCH.md.
